        "original_id": "f553b724-3d76-5fcb-8f6e-a483df5630e0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Leo, Ravi\n- Groups: Stiltskin, Genesis, VIXX, VIXX LR\n- Companies: Jellyfish Entertainment\n- Roles: vocalists, rapper, singer, songwriter, musical theatre actor\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Ray Wilson is best known as a vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin and in Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Leo, whose birth name is Jung Taek-woon, was born on 10 November 1990 and is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and musical theatre actor.\n- Leo is signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\n- VIXX LR was established in August 2015.\n- VIXX LR consists of VIXX's main vocalist Leo and main rapper Ravi.\n- The VIXX videography covers the South Korean boy band VIXX and their sub-unit VIXX LR.\n- Jellyfish Entertainment formed VIXX LR.",
